          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ウインドウを閉じても動き続け、異常があれば通知します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breaker shows in the sidebar whether these apps are running. You won't be notified when one quits." : {
